      ":question/problem": "Without using a calculator, find the exact value of\n$$\n2\\,\\sin\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{8}\\right)\\cos\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right).\n$$\nUse $2\\sin x\\cos x=\\sin(2x)$, first with $x=\\frac{\\pi}{8}$ and then with $x=\\frac{\\pi}{4}$.",
